Creating a full-featured HTML5 game with virtual joystick, mobile support, NPC combat, vehicle driving, mission system, and large map is an ambitious project. Below is a **complete, runnable HTML5 game** that demonstrates the core systems you requested.

> ✅ Features included:
> - **Virtual Joystick** (touch + mouse)
> - **Mobile-friendly** (touch + mouse)
> - **NPC Combat** (shoot, dodge, AI)
> - **Vehicle Driving** (steer, accelerate, brake)
> - **Mission System** (active, complete, rewards)
> - **Large Map** (tile-based with parallax)
> - **Vehicle Stealing** (from NPCs)
> - **Inventory / Stats**
> - **Weapon System**

