## ✨ What This Tool Does

### 📐 Plane Figures
- **Circle** — area, circumference
- **Triangle** — Heron’s formula area, perimeter
- **Regular Polygon** — area via n·s²/(4·tan(π/n)), perimeter
- **Rectangle** — area, perimeter
- **Square** (polygon n=4)

### 📦 Solid Figures
- **Sphere** — surface area, volume
- **Cylinder** — lateral + top/bottom area, volume
- **Cone** — lateral + base area, volume
- **Rectangular Prism** — surface area, volume

### 🎨 Interactive Preview
- Real-time canvas redraw
- Labeled dimensions (r, h, a, b, c, l, w, n)
- Grid background for scale
- Shape name centered

### 📝 Formulas
- Toggle formulas on/off
- Monospace formulas with parameter substitution

### ⚠️ Validation
- Non-negative numbers only
- Triangle inequality check (visual only — uses Heron’s)
- Invalid inputs highlighted

### 🎮 UX
- Responsive (mobile-friendly)
- Keyboard navigation
- Toast for errors
- Chip-based metric selection (Area/Perimeter/Volume/Surface)

